## F - Compare and Decide

Record at least one accepted, modified and rejected AI suggestion.

Patient, Practitioner, and Appointment are all the same Classes that were identified in the other documents – Accepted.

AppointmentBook. This suggestion is a potentially good idea, as the Appointment Class is already going to be overloaded with displaying the appointments and checking the Patient Name, Practitioner Name, and Time and Date for any overlapping appointment. However, the AI has stated many things between the AppointmentBook and Appointment Classes which overlap, hence why this idea is Rejected. Because if they are already overlapping then merging them would be easier.

DataStore. This is a rejected suggestion, as the Appointment Class is already handling this task.

UserInterface. This is rejected. The User Interface would not be run through a class, as there is no need to run multiple at a time. For each device running this software there is only a need for one User Interface, although creating a class could allow for multiple devices to use it easier.


